{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions","id":174324,"title":"Heirs to Hell Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-19T11:20:40-07:00","id":174324,"title":"Heirs to Hell Questions","content":"I started glancing through Heirs to Hell today, and something jumped out at me that I'm not sure is further referenced in the text or not.<br /> <br /> &quot;Only if the demon parent has no other Covers will the fetus become the child of the parent\u2019s demonic form \u2014 a thoroughly unpredictable and quite often dangerous state of affairs.&quot;<br /> <br /> Is this further elaborated on, and if not,has anyone heard mention of plans to delve into this farther in the future?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2382-krimcl","name":"krimcl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T12:06:15-07:00","id":174415,"title":"","content":"I think it's pretty clear-the child is carried by covers until there are no covers, and then is carried in the Demonic Form. A demon running around in his true form, attracting attention from all the wrong people, with a body probably not designed to carry children, is bound to end badly if not resolved quickly. There's a good chance the demon and child will die because of those factors.<br /> <br /> Don't think there's anything else going on with this. What do you think it's saying?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T12:14:28-07:00","id":174421,"title":"","content":"I think the implied question is whether you can have an awesome scary demon cyborg monster baby.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T12:19:02-07:00","id":174424,"title":"","content":"Ah, the answer to that is &quot;Play Promethean&quot;.<br /> <br /> Offspring are humans-hell, even Fractals are human.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T12:45:31-07:00","id":174454,"title":"","content":"This one is left to the imagination of the troupe, and that's probably for the best. It's something that isn't likely to happen more than once in a given chronicle, so make something up that makes the story more interesting.<br /> <br /> Is it dangerous only because having to spend the entirety of labor in demonic form is likely to bring down the hunter angels (as is getting temporarily locked in demonic form during pregnancy)? Is it unpredictable because there is some weird effect like an Embed/Exploit the demon can't control? Maybe the demon can't resist shifting into demonic form when she's under a lot of stress - even if it will actually make matters worse. Maybe &quot;unpredictable and dangerous&quot; means the resultant child ends up something quite obviously inhuman (such as a born Exile).<br /> <br /> Before you go the full Innsmouth look route on this, however, please be mindful of your players. There is a difference between body horror and outright ickiness, and while the line isn't in the same place for everyone, pregnancy is a particularly delicate subject.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T12:49:10-07:00","id":174457,"title":"","content":"It was more that a 4th type of Demon offspring appeared to be presented, albeit a more NPC-esque one rather than a PC one (And this is 'a player supplement').<br /> <br /> With how in depth the book looks from what I've seen so far I was curious if rules or at least an example of one existed that I was missing from a quick glance at the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2382-krimcl","name":"krimcl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T12:57:11-07:00","id":174482,"title":"","content":"Hmm. By and large, I still think the child is supposed to pop out human, and the implication is more for how dangerous it is to be like that. Still, there's a good story there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T13:13:12-07:00","id":174499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>krimcl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=174457#post174457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It was more that a 4th type of Demon offspring appeared to be presented, albeit a more NPC-esque one rather than a PC one (And this is 'a player supplement').<br /> <br /> With how in depth the book looks from what I've seen so far I was curious if rules or at least an example of one existed that I was missing from a quick glance at the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>The line in question was one of mine, and I intended it along the lines of what ArcaneArts suggested. That said, I can see where it might imply something more bizarre like a 4th type of demon-blooded (which would fit the game's numerology nicely). I'm not in the habit of telling Storytellers they shouldn't do something they think is cool just because I didn't mean it that way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T23:03:20-07:00","id":175002,"title":"","content":"There are a lot more options for high weirdness thanks to cover shifting during pregnancy.<br /> <br /> Parenthood gets shifted to animal cover.<br /> <br /> Parenthood gets shifted to inanimate object/machine cover.<br /> <br /> Parenthood gets shifted to ghost cover.<br /> <br /> Parenthood gets shifted to spirit cover.<br /> <br /> And as for children deleted thanks to the parent burning their cover, well ask any mage, something not existing doesn't mean it'll go away.<br /> <br /> Perhaps in some of those cases the children will be cryptids, but I guess the writers didn't want the demons going all lunar exalted with their reproductive cycles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 06-20-2014, 02:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T08:02:58-07:00","id":175250,"title":"","content":"Unless I am missing something big, the text never says what the demon-blooded's effective Primum is; is it safe to assume it's 1? If it's 0 there are several Embeds that become literally useless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T08:27:08-07:00","id":175257,"title":"","content":"Cipher Question below (put in spoilers cause I think it's spoiler-warned in the book):<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">What do you think a Demon-Blooded Cipher means to an Unchained Cipher. I mean they definitely work differently but do they really work that differently? I mean an unchained gets to ask one of the 4 questions when they gain a beat in anywhere that's God-Machine related could that mean that the God-Machine is nudging along the Demon under specified task? I want to say no but I also want to say yes. I know there is going to be no one answer that is better so I ask you all: What do you think it means/ What is it going to mean in your game that you run? </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T08:58:27-07:00","id":175273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kirby Jerusalem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=175250#post175250\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unless I am missing something big, the text never says what the demon-blooded's effective Primum is; is it safe to assume it's 1? If it's 0 there are several Embeds that become literally useless.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh, doy. Yeah, effective Primum is 1 for a demon-blooded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T15:03:45-07:00","id":175559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=175273#post175273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Oh, doy. Yeah, effective Primum is 1 for a demon-blooded.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks Matt, appreciate it!<br /> <br /> For my own games, I'm considering letting Fractals spend Aether to boost their effective Primum 1-for-1. Judging from a quick reread through the Embeds that shouldn't be too big of a balance problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T22:14:58-07:00","id":175779,"title":"","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> after reading the rules-part of the book i'm not sure about two things:<br /> <br /> - Can Fractals and Offspring actively learn new Embeds, or are they limited to their Keys and (in case of fractals) starting Embed?<br /> - What about rules for creating demon-blooded children or adolescents? They are mentioned in the introduction text of the section, but I can not find them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1125-gflash","name":"gflash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1125_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T05:52:30-07:00","id":175940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gflash</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=175779#post175779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello,<br /> <br /> after reading the rules-part of the book i'm not sure about two things:<br /> <br /> - Can Fractals and Offspring actively learn new Embeds, or are they limited to their Keys and (in case of fractals) starting Embed?<br /> - What about rules for creating demon-blooded children or adolescents? They are mentioned in the introduction text of the section, but I can not find them.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. Yes, they can learn Embeds more or less like demons can.<br /> <br /> 2. Matt originally wanted to do a refresh of the rules from Innocents to bring them up to date with GMC rules, but there simply wasn't space. You may have located an artifact of that intention in the text.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T11:36:28-07:00","id":176249,"title":"","content":"I will totally pay for a GMC Update to Innocents. Just want that out there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T01:41:15-07:00","id":176840,"title":"","content":"Seconded. Any others for the motion?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T02:22:30-07:00","id":176871,"title":"","content":"It's going to be interesting to see how/if/when the various blue book stuff gets updated to GMC, like Skinchangers, Second Sight, Innocents, etc. It'll be interesting to see if it comes out of different projects like Heirs or if they might do a Big Book of Blue Book Updates.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T02:28:37-07:00","id":176874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=176249#post176249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will totally pay for a GMC Update to Innocents. Just want that out there.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> One thing I wish Innocents had had at least sidebars on was discussion of Embraced children (lots of questions here - do they become adults in child bodies, or does maturation by its nature stop with undeath - and that's aside from the simpler questions like &quot;should they be considered to use adult stats, or still have 'adults win' child stats unless they use Disciplines?&quot;); Awakened children (by trope this rare phenomena should be extra powerful, but lack control over their magic); children who come back through the Hedge; Prometheans made from child bodies; Bound children; etc etc etc.<br /> <br /> If there were an updated book, I'd push for this LOUDLY.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 06-22-2014, 09:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T02:36:04-07:00","id":176879,"title":"","content":"I'd like that too. One of my favourite characters was an adult Changeling who got turned back into a child by her Keeper, so rules for Lost children would be pretty neat.<br /> <br /> (Vampire kids should definitely be stuck with a child's mind)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 06-22-2014, 05:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T06:29:08-07:00","id":176941,"title":"","content":"So, I really wanted to do more with the idea of supernatural-creature children in <b>Innocents</b>, but I ran out of both time and space (seriously, that book was put together <i>really</i> quickly). I would love to do a supplement dealing that that. Maybe I'll pitch it sometime.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T06:30:44-07:00","id":176944,"title":"","content":"Please do; my one big request would be a section, a little one should suffice, on Talecrafting tropes appropriate to young Lost.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T20:21:37-07:00","id":177590,"title":"","content":"Is there going to be a character sheet produced for Heirs to Hell? A blending of the mortals sheet with Integrity and a spot for the cipher and embeds. My pdfing skills are not up to the challenge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Games - <a href=\"https://dust-and-shadow.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Dust and Shadow</a> (Vampire)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/626-darkfool","name":"DarkFool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar626_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T02:29:08-07:00","id":177776,"title":"","content":"Well, we will have to develop them won't we DarkFool? The writers will hopefully be too busy making more goodies and Mr.Gone is backlogged to the nth degree.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T04:05:44-07:00","id":177818,"title":"","content":"Hmm goodies. Will have to see what we can do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Games - <a href=\"https://dust-and-shadow.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Dust and Shadow</a> (Vampire)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/626-darkfool","name":"DarkFool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar626_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T06:09:38-07:00","id":177869,"title":"","content":"So after going through a steep learning curve (and not watching the latest Penny Dreadful), I have mutated the official Demon character sheet into a very unofficial Heirs to Hell sheet. I have loaded it up onto Google Drive <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B6-2yKTmkgkFbjQ5eS1MNm96RzA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Hope it helps until more practised hands get a chance to produce a sheet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Games - <a href=\"https://dust-and-shadow.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Dust and Shadow</a> (Vampire)","edited":{"userid":626,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/626-darkfool","user":"DarkFool","date":". 06-23-2014, 09:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/626-darkfool","name":"DarkFool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar626_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T22:04:15-07:00","id":178652,"title":"","content":"I'd also pay for a GMC update to Innocents, same goes for Second Sight and Immortals.<br /> Even have a tidy little fund set aside, just in case any kickstarters or new launches come up that I just can't resist <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","name":"Asaram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T05:21:55-07:00","id":178817,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkFool</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=177869#post177869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So after going through a steep learning curve (and not watching the latest Penny Dreadful), I have mutated the official Demon character sheet into a very unofficial Heirs to Hell sheet. I have loaded it up onto Google Drive <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B6-2yKTmkgkFbjQ5eS1MNm96RzA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Hope it helps until more practised hands get a chance to produce a sheet.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B6xXhg9cZKBadUpoVXQzc3gwSDg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Thar ya go laddie.</a> Hmmmm, tired and filled with scotch... I shouldn't be on here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T12:50:46-07:00","id":179969,"title":"","content":"Do we have an ETA for Heirs to Hell for those of us who didn't kickstart, or?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T03:32:14-07:00","id":182766,"title":"","content":"Can demon-blooded be Sleepwalkers or Wolf-blooded? Can demon-blooded Awaken?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T07:29:22-07:00","id":182858,"title":"","content":"As of Fallen World(admittedly not out yet), any human with a supernatural template like Demon-blooded counts as a Sleepwalker.<br /> <br /> I don't remember if certain minor templates can cross, but I assume if they can, these aren't one of them, so probably no Demon-Wolf-Blooded.<br /> <br /> A demon-blooded can Awaken like any other minor template, but they lose that template when they do so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T08:15:17-07:00","id":182904,"title":"","content":"What happens when an Unchained with a male Cover has to give birth to the child and cannot switch to a female Cover? What if the demon has no Cover and no humanoid-enough body?<br /> <br /> Can an Unchained with male Cover impregnate his own female Cover by spilling semen on a container, switching Covers and using the semen to impregnate itself? If yes, is it going to be a one-parented Fractal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":316,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","user":"Jesuncolo","date":". 06-28-2014, 11:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T08:24:37-07:00","id":182911,"title":"","content":"1)Body horror. THe book goes into more detail if you so desire to know about it.<br /> <br /> 2)That's...What?I don't think that's viable.EDIT: Oh, wait, container, not counter. My bad. Still, weird question.<br /> <br /> ...and then it occurs to me that with things like Alibi and such, it might be possible for one to have sex with one's self.<br /> <br /> Gah, this conversation just got weird. <br /> <br /> Now as for self artificial-insemination....Um, I have no idea. If a baby came out of that though, I'd give it a permanent condition though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 06-28-2014, 11:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T08:29:00-07:00","id":182916,"title":"","content":"Can &quot;Going Native&quot; (Flowers of Hell) temporarily suppress the Activated Condition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T14:52:33-07:00","id":183244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jesuncolo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=182916#post182916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can &quot;Going Native&quot; (Flowers of Hell) temporarily suppress the Activated Condition?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sounds reasonable. <br /> <br /> As to the &quot;can demon-blooded Awaken, etc.&quot; question, <i>my</i> answer is that I don't have any problem with that and I love crossover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T15:05:23-07:00","id":183251,"title":"","content":"When you say that, do you mean retaining the demon-blooded properties?<br /> <br /> Cause that would be awesome. A new form of cosmic power at the push of the God-Machine's button? Scary stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T18:34:33-07:00","id":183411,"title":"","content":"Matt's the final word on this, but I can answer you all pretty simply. <br /> <br /> What's good for your story? Because that's the answer. <br /> <br /> More specifically? Wolfblooded can be demonblooded, because why not? Male covers can have babies because... well, don't get hung up on genitalia and gender, man. It ain't worth it. A good story is all that matters. Can a demon get itself pregnant? Sure. Again. Why not? Can demonblooded Awaken? That's a little fussier. I'd say yes, but again. Story story story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/184-filamena","name":"Filamena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar184_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T20:58:23-07:00","id":183469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=183251#post183251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When you say that, do you mean retaining the demon-blooded properties?<br /> <br /> Cause that would be awesome. A new form of cosmic power at the push of the God-Machine's button? Scary stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>God I love you folks and your wild, story hook-rich ideas! It seriously makes me glad I write for a game with such clever people. An Activated mage sounds like fun in any game if the ST isn't afraid of a little bit of crossover - particularly as an NPC, but even a PC who occasionally wakes up with missing time with half his Mana used up and the Guardians waiting to ask him some *very* pointed questions has some serious potential.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T21:14:55-07:00","id":183494,"title":"","content":"I've had a child of a demon and a faerie turned mage in my head for a long time, even prior to Demon's release(in fact,I figured large part of the reason the kid awakened was because he was just seeing too much)-then Heirs came out and that really got me excited, and then you three opened the door for mixing and matching.<br /> <br /> One iteration of Chicago just got a whole lot worse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T21:27:37-07:00","id":183499,"title":"","content":"In related news, the confluence of new info from Heirs and Flowers has me contemplating demon-blooded dynasties with their demonic roots acting as sort of patron gods of the family - Latent kids getting given gadgets to seed their eventual awakening into Offspring, Fractal heads-of-house, Embedded adoption pacts, the worrying implications that the demon-blooded Cipher has for such a cluster\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T21:38:40-07:00","id":183504,"title":"","content":"My question is, can demonblooded make gadgets? They know embeds, and that seems to be the only requirement, but I can't recall that being addressed in the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T21:42:13-07:00","id":183506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=183504#post183504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> My question is, can demonblooded make gadgets? They know embeds, and that seems to be the only requirement, but I can't recall that being addressed in the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Needs Aether and native comprehension of arcane physics and the roll uses Primum. Seems an intuitive &quot;no.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T22:09:10-07:00","id":183517,"title":"","content":"Some demonblooded do have aether pools, but that's a factor.<br /> <br /> How do you see demonic comprehension of arcane physics resulting in embeds as differing from demonblooded comprehension of acane physics resulting in embeds? Not being argumentative, but the rules are the same, the fluff is the same, I'm not seeing the difference you are here.<br /> <br /> Didn't it get mentioned that demonblooded have an effective primium rating of 1 in the errata?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T22:47:32-07:00","id":183541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=183517#post183517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Some demonblooded do have aether pools, but that's a factor.<br /> <br /> How do you see demonic comprehension of arcane physics resulting in embeds as differing from demonblooded comprehension of acane physics resulting in embeds? Not being argumentative, but the rules are the same, the fluff is the same, I'm not seeing the difference you are here.</div> </div> </div> </div>In the Ambient Aether section: &quot;Demon-bloods do not possess the natural affinity for Aether manipulation that the Unchained do, and so they cannot create the reliable Exploits that demons can.&quot; The Unchained have to negotiate the arrangement of Aether to such a fine degree that they force reality to replace a mundane object with a similar-looking replacement that symbolizes a particular interpretation of the effect of that Embed. Something as indelicate as supercharging doesn't seem analogous.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Didn't it get mentioned that demonblooded have an effective primium rating of 1 in the errata? </div> </div> </div>For the purposes of effects that use a character's Primum rating to set a value like several Embeds do, yes, lest those Embeds be needlessly rendered useless to demon-blooded.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T01:34:41-07:00","id":183654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=183499#post183499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In related news, the confluence of new info from Heirs and Flowers has me contemplating demon-blooded dynasties with their demonic roots acting as sort of patron gods of the family - Latent kids getting given gadgets to seed their eventual awakening into Offspring, Fractal heads-of-house, Embedded adoption pacts, the worrying implications that the demon-blooded Cipher has for such a cluster\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So the Lucifuge? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/137x125q90/745/a5GS5M.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/802-amaterasu","name":"amaterasu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"208"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T22:12:21-07:00","id":184540,"title":"","content":"Okay, fair enough, I still wish the book had said something but I can definitely see where you are coming from.<br /> <br /> Speaking of the lucifuge, anyone think it's a complete and total shame that living gadgets only remain gadgets for a month? Oh well maybe a lambda gadget that combines that with hellhound.....<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-30T10:27:00-07:00","id":184939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amaterasu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/174324-heirs-to-hell-questions?p=183654#post183654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> So the Lucifuge? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>At last check an assembly of children of &quot;demons&quot; of widely varying origins whose main unifying factor is how many generations the blood skipped was decidedly different from a true-breeding bloodline stemming from the same parent, to say nothing of how &quot;a family descended from demons who mostly do their own thing while occasionally trading favors with Great-Grandmaw&quot; is pretty much on the opposite end of the spectrum from &quot;demon-blooded demon-hunters.&quot;<br /> <br /> :|","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/a